# Task 1 Report — Schema-v3 Resource-Only Manifest

## Behavior changed

- Active PIT optimizer run manifests now require and construct `schema_version=3`.
- `PitOptimizerCallBudget`, `AuthorizationRequirement`, and `PitOptimizerGateConfig` no longer contain or validate enforcing `max_usd` fields.
- Closed manifest parsing now rejects legacy `max_usd` keys because each affected closed dataclass no longer permits them.
- The subset canary accepts exactly two ordered investigator/author/critic iterations with the approved resource-only role tuples and exactly 448,000 total input-plus-output tokens.
- The provider-free manifest CLI no longer defines or reads per-role `--*-max-usd` arguments, and its prepare command carries calls, tokens, and iterations without an optimizer `--max-usd` option.

